# Pixi environment + lockfile.
# The lockfile is gitignored by policy: a fresh clone re-solves instead of
# replaying pinned artifacts. `exclude-newer` in pixi.toml bounds that re-solve
# to a known-good window so the env does not drift between machines.
.pixi/
pixi.lock

# Regenerated by `pixi run docs-corpus` — md5 + capture date per source file.
docs-corpus/.fingerprints